      "text": "FK-A/B: (id, material_id, dimension) + tenant_id.\nNo standalone posting.material_id -> material FK.",
      "originalText": "FK-A/B: (id, material_id, dimension) + tenant_id.\nNo standalone posting.material_id -> material FK.",
