      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Placement: parent_id XOR location_id.\nactive_holding: one OPEN holding per\n(material_id, container_id), not per container.\nPosting: holding_id XOR account.\nUK movement(output_id, member).",
      "originalText": "Placement: parent_id XOR location_id.\nactive_holding: one OPEN holding per\n(material_id, container_id), not per container.\nPosting: holding_id XOR account.\nUK movement(output_id, member).",
